B.ard=new A.bM(B.jy,["When are weekly earnings and incentives settled?","Earnings are settled every Monday by 12:00 PM directly to your registered bank account or UPI ID. Daily instant payouts can be requested from the Earnings screen up to 3 times per day."],t.li)
B.arf=new A.bM(B.jy,["How do passenger cancellation fees work?","If a passenger cancels after 3 minutes from booking, or fails to arrive at the pickup spot within 5 minutes of your arrival, a cancellation fee of \u20b930 - \u20b950 is credited directly to your captain balance."],t.li)
B.arc=new A.bM(B.jy,["What should I do if a passenger misbehaves or damages the vehicle?",'Ensure your safety first. If you are in immediate danger, use the SOS Emergency button (112). For non-emergencies, complete or cancel the ride and file a complaint under "Rider Misconduct / Damage" with photos of any damages.'],t.li)
B.are=new A.bM(B.jy,["Why is my ride fare different from the estimate?","Fares are recalculated based on actual GPS distance travelled and total trip duration. High traffic or passenger-requested route deviations will increase the final fare."],t.li)
B.arg=new A.bM(B.jy,["How does the QuickRide Captain commission rate work?","QuickRide operates on a low flat commission of 10% per ride. During peak incentive windows, commission is waived or subsidised with bonus earnings."],t.li)
